Package: yunmai-noble
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/Vanuan/yunmai-noble
Depends: adduser, ca-certificates, dbus, libc6 (>= @LIBC@)
Recommends: bluez
Suggests: nodejs (>= 22)
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Bluetooth scale service and web dashboard
 Yunmai Noble reads Yunmai Bluetooth scales through BlueZ over D-Bus,
 stores measurements in SQLite, and serves a web dashboard and JSON/SSE
 API from a single Bun process.
 .
 This package installs the systemd service, a bundled Bun runtime, the
 web assets, and the yunmai-noble command. The service runs as the
 unprivileged yunmai user and keeps its database in /var/lib/yunmai-noble.
 It has no GUI dependencies; install yunmai-noble-full for the service
 and the GPUI desktop client together.
